{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multimodal setup with ResNet50 images and concatenation fusion, comparing it to PCA-encoded RNA in config_016. The validation accuracy of 0.5362 (vs. 0.5266 for PCA in config_016) suggests the scvi_n200 encoder may contribute to performance improvements, though other factors like fusion or aggregation could also influence results. The role of RNA encoder selection in multimodal performance remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative encoders or additional design variations."
}

